      <activity id="9207eaf5-2849-5bb3-9505-83045dd8f196" activityNameId="8fdbe99a-816f-5970-9993-7dfcc4309e82" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 600kW, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 600kW, moving parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 736 MWh. Most data are from a Nordex N43/600 plant, a few are extrapolations from the module "wind power plant 30kW, moving parts".;
UUID: fa64df2d-104b-3baa-8399-98f681ac9005
Includes materials used for moving parts: rotor, nacelle, electric parts, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the energy requirements for assembling, the transports needed, and  the connection to the grid.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average European technology of a 600 kW wind power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fa64df2d-104b-3baa-8399-98f681ac9005.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
